  "description": "⚒️ **Founded: 25-08-2024** ⚒️\n\n🌍 Timezone: GMT+2\n\n════════════════════════\n\n📩 **Applying**:\n\n- DISCORD IS REQUIRED &amp; MANDATORY\n- Combat LVL 90+\n- Guild Discord: DM pyrrhanikos2480 or desskit or chill_ac on discord.\n\n════════════════════════\n\n📖 **Guild Guidelines**:\n\n- Building up a community and helping each other is more important than playing the game - this is why we require discord.\n- We are a resilient guild with a semi-long history of ups and downs. We have survived so far and we aren&#039;t giving up. \n- Higher level players will handle challenges and marks, but not participating in raids or signs of prolonged inactivity leads to exclusion.\n\n\n════════════════════════\n\n⚔️ **Daily Guild Activities and Services**:\n\n- Daily raids (except conquest days) and weekly conquests (Wednesday/Friday)\n- World boss pings, activity reminders (via Discord)\n- Forge service, you provide recipe and materials, crafting is free - except for mythic trade tax (ask on Discord)\n- Meditation buff service (ask on Discord)\n- Alchemy service, you provide materials, crafting is free (ask on Discord)\n- House guest service (ask on Discord)",
